WEBVTT

01:26.210 --> 01:31.730
[The Ingenious One]

01:33.130 --> 01:39.590
[Episode 3: A Fascinating Way Out of Danger]

01:58.510 --> 01:59.960
Halt!

02:03.240 --> 02:04.336
Mr. Su,

02:04.360 --> 02:05.390
the road ahead is destroyed

02:05.390 --> 02:06.840
and impassable.

02:07.680 --> 02:08.595
Miss Shu,

02:08.619 --> 02:09.726
the post road ahead is destroyed.

02:09.750 --> 02:10.976
We need to delay for a while.

02:11.000 --> 02:11.776
Mr. Su...

02:11.800 --> 02:13.250
Cut the crap.

02:13.620 --> 02:15.070
Jin.

02:15.750 --> 02:16.870
I-I didn't say anything.

02:16.870 --> 02:18.186
Am I so annoying to him?

02:18.210 --> 02:20.740
I guess he’s still mad about the raw silk purchase yesterday.

02:23.000 --> 02:24.916
Today is probably not gonna be a quiet day.

02:24.940 --> 02:26.390
Sure.

02:27.240 --> 02:28.116
Do you have a plan?

02:28.140 --> 02:31.050
The sword is ruthless, while prowess is all that matters.

02:31.390 --> 02:34.060
You two are my plan.

02:47.930 --> 02:49.866
The truth you've been waiting for 15 years

02:49.890 --> 02:51.826
is worse than you can imagine.

02:51.850 --> 02:54.686
Love and hatred are all born from human hearts.

02:54.710 --> 02:57.066
Only those who get rid of them can enter the Yuntai Sect.

02:57.090 --> 02:58.126
Yun Xiang,

02:58.150 --> 02:59.966
you still can't let it go.

02:59.990 --> 03:02.510
And you still wanna investigate it, huh?

03:02.550 --> 03:04.000
Luo is my family name.

03:05.550 --> 03:07.070
I'm Luo Wenjia.

03:40.170 --> 03:41.620
Do you feel cold?

04:01.690 --> 04:02.766
We are like brothers.

04:02.790 --> 04:04.240
So don't mind it.

04:21.030 --> 04:22.700
What do you expect him to do?

04:28.260 --> 04:30.006
He knew something would happen tonight,

04:30.030 --> 04:31.870
while he still fell asleep in peace.

04:32.110 --> 04:34.280
That makes me feel much better.

04:34.350 --> 04:36.230
You should boast some martial arts skills.

04:36.340 --> 04:38.046
If someone breaks in tonight,

04:38.070 --> 04:39.610
do you need my help?

04:42.620 --> 04:44.250
I've seen you use your moving technique.

04:44.940 --> 04:48.189
Ordinary people couldn't have dodged those bolts.

04:50.970 --> 04:52.420
To be honest with you,

04:52.640 --> 04:55.610
once I use my moving technique,

04:56.110 --> 04:57.916
you can't hurt me at all

04:57.940 --> 04:59.670
even if you and Jin work together.

05:01.110 --> 05:02.176
In this case,

05:02.200 --> 05:04.020
why did you ask us to protect you?

05:05.990 --> 05:09.830
Just because there's a little flaw in this moving technique.

05:10.410 --> 05:11.860
For example?

05:15.430 --> 05:17.540
How can I show my fatal flaw to others so easily?

05:24.230 --> 05:25.680
Mr. Su,

05:27.270 --> 05:28.720
come here to warm yourself up.

05:30.910 --> 05:32.360
This

05:32.430 --> 05:33.880
is enough.

05:42.840 --> 05:44.800
You ruined my plan yesterday.

05:45.140 --> 05:46.590
Take this as punishment.

05:58.440 --> 06:00.246
I think, even if he didn't stop you,

06:00.270 --> 06:01.586
the steward by your side

06:01.610 --> 06:03.520
might not follow your wish either.

06:05.540 --> 06:06.916
If I insisted,

06:06.940 --> 06:08.820
Qian couldn't stop me.

06:08.870 --> 06:10.266
The Su family has been the royal supplier for over a decade

06:10.290 --> 06:11.376
as a big and wealthy clan.

06:11.400 --> 06:13.560
You must be acting so absurdly

06:13.590 --> 06:15.470
for some reason, right?

06:17.180 --> 06:20.066
You thought you were smart and said something

06:20.090 --> 06:21.796
to fulfill your own wish.

06:21.820 --> 06:23.630
But what you said

06:23.740 --> 06:26.010
will get others into a lot of trouble.

06:28.730 --> 06:30.846
Then how about you explain it to us?

06:30.870 --> 06:32.820
So I can know what I did wrong.

06:41.299 --> 06:43.170
After my father passed away,

06:43.530 --> 06:46.960
the Su family's business in the Nandu Chamber of Commerce

06:47.150 --> 06:49.050
has been managed by my sister alone.

06:49.740 --> 06:52.189
But I'm the only son of my father.

06:52.380 --> 06:54.530
My sister wants me to take over it anxiously.

06:55.080 --> 06:57.310
This time, I came to Yangzhou to buy silk.

06:57.350 --> 06:58.275
Firstly,

06:58.299 --> 07:01.166
she wanted me to gain some experience.

07:01.190 --> 07:03.136
I did have some personal business,

07:03.160 --> 07:04.710
and I wanted to make some money.

07:04.810 --> 07:06.206
Well,

07:06.230 --> 07:07.366
I was supposed to make a deal with them soon

07:07.390 --> 07:08.956
and have some fun,

07:08.980 --> 07:10.820
so my sister's wish could be fulfilled.

07:11.820 --> 07:14.010
Who knew you'd get in the way?

07:15.820 --> 07:17.890
The Su family is already the head of merchants.

07:18.040 --> 07:20.360
Why don't you go into business?

07:22.470 --> 07:26.000
Merchants... I've seen too many merchants.

07:26.180 --> 07:29.050
Only two types of people will dig into business.

07:29.250 --> 07:31.170
Profiteers,

07:31.240 --> 07:32.870
and those who have no other way out.

07:33.140 --> 07:34.326
So boring.

07:34.350 --> 07:37.756
So you must be an ambitious person, Mr. Su.

07:37.780 --> 07:39.320
Of course.

07:40.799 --> 07:42.406
I aim to travel around the world with a sword.

07:42.430 --> 07:43.670
If I can learn the best of all schools

07:43.690 --> 07:45.156
and become a grand master,

07:45.180 --> 07:45.930
isn't that good?

07:45.950 --> 07:47.400
Shut up!

07:56.120 --> 07:57.570
There come some villains!

08:30.230 --> 08:31.096
Let's get closer.

08:31.120 --> 08:32.016
Don't panic.

08:32.040 --> 08:34.630
Martial arts are not learned with the mouth. Learn more skills.

08:34.660 --> 08:36.110
Let's go.

08:40.049 --> 08:41.499
Go after them!

08:52.510 --> 08:53.686
Do not protect me.

08:53.710 --> 08:55.510
Violators will be fined three months' wages.

08:56.470 --> 08:57.920
Make way!

09:11.630 --> 09:13.080
Catch up with her!

09:15.350 --> 09:16.086
Qian.

09:16.110 --> 09:16.976
Young Master,

09:17.000 --> 09:19.360
you don't need to handle these guys.

11:06.830 --> 11:08.350
What moving technique is this?

11:08.410 --> 11:09.876
I've never seen it before.

11:09.900 --> 11:12.540
He can make a way out when surrounded on all sides.

11:15.050 --> 11:17.166
Looks like this guy wasn't bragging.

11:17.190 --> 11:19.750
It's hard to break it even if the two of us work together.

11:39.070 --> 11:40.790
How much longer do you wanna watch?

11:41.570 --> 11:43.190
Just a little longer!

11:50.540 --> 11:52.140
It's enough. Please stop.

11:52.330 --> 11:53.576
If you force me to fight,

11:53.600 --> 11:55.160
you will die for sure!

12:06.560 --> 12:07.406
Help!

12:07.430 --> 12:08.880
Help me!

12:24.350 --> 12:27.210
The technique will stop working after ten breaths.

12:27.740 --> 12:29.270
So this is the fatal flaw.

12:30.900 --> 12:32.460
If you wanna test my martial arts,

12:32.900 --> 12:35.216
I'll tell you after you ask me a few more times.

12:35.240 --> 12:37.256
You don't have to kill me.

12:37.280 --> 12:38.966
If I didn't go that far,

12:38.990 --> 12:40.750
would you tell me honestly?

12:41.860 --> 12:42.856
And you!

12:42.880 --> 12:44.710
You didn't well protect your master, you know?

12:46.740 --> 12:49.460
Does your useless technique have a name?

12:51.000 --> 12:52.056
Run for Ten Breaths.

12:52.080 --> 12:52.566
Pardon?

12:52.590 --> 12:54.040
Run for Ten Breaths!

13:17.550 --> 13:18.716
Mr. Yun,

13:18.740 --> 13:20.270
have you ever seen these guys?

13:22.330 --> 13:24.960
Mr. Qian, did you find out who these villains are?

13:28.190 --> 13:30.100
As long as you're safe, Mr. Yun.

13:30.650 --> 13:32.570
I saw it clearly tonight.

13:32.760 --> 13:34.930
These people are not bandits.

13:35.220 --> 13:36.700
They just targeted you.

13:39.580 --> 13:41.030
If they were bandits,

13:41.110 --> 13:42.680
they would have hidden by day and come out by night,

13:42.870 --> 13:44.900
whose skin wouldn't be so dark.

13:46.860 --> 13:48.310
Look.

13:48.550 --> 13:50.000
Water ringworm.

13:50.950 --> 13:54.510
They have solid shoulders and thick thighs.

13:55.000 --> 13:56.940
It's caused by years of weight bearing.

14:01.110 --> 14:05.110
Could they be the members of the Cao Sect?

14:05.170 --> 14:05.990
The Cao Sect

14:05.990 --> 14:08.206
could have safely escorted us to the Nandu Wharf.

14:08.230 --> 14:09.990
But they kept refusing.

14:10.430 --> 14:13.380
So we had to take this remote post road.

14:18.760 --> 14:20.210
Mr. Yun,

14:20.960 --> 14:25.110
do you have a grudge against the Cao Sect?

14:28.290 --> 14:30.020
If you think this is the truth,

14:30.620 --> 14:32.070
then just let it be.

14:37.860 --> 14:38.706
Jin,

14:38.730 --> 14:41.046
your swordplay looks so fierce.

14:41.070 --> 14:43.710
I once thought you inherited it from the Wu family in Nandu.

14:43.810 --> 14:46.626
But the Wus' swordplay, Twelve Hanging-rock Techniques,

14:46.650 --> 14:48.256
is mainly about flawless attacks,

14:48.280 --> 14:49.656
not winning by speed.

14:49.680 --> 14:52.526
But I saw you attacking three persons

14:52.550 --> 14:54.270
at lightning speed.

14:55.710 --> 14:58.206
I'm just a swordsman. I have nothing to do with the inheritance.

14:58.230 --> 15:00.326
I just have travelled a lot and seen a lot.

15:00.350 --> 15:01.766
You're right.

15:01.790 --> 15:03.206
Your swordplay

15:03.230 --> 15:04.966
boasts the trait of the Liu family in Yuezhou.

15:04.990 --> 15:06.746
But the Lius' swordplay

15:06.770 --> 15:08.996
is like a steady downpour of rain.

15:09.020 --> 15:12.206
What's the point of these fancy names?

15:12.230 --> 15:13.680
The swordplay

15:14.280 --> 15:16.000
is used to kill people.

15:16.810 --> 15:18.980
Nope, Jin.

15:19.120 --> 15:21.696
Knowing yourself and your enemy, you can fight a hundred battles and win them all.

15:21.720 --> 15:23.926
Your swordplay seems quite sharp,

15:23.950 --> 15:25.856
but it's not flawless.

15:25.880 --> 15:27.330
Not flawless?

15:28.020 --> 15:29.470
Go ahead.

15:33.290 --> 15:34.246
This sword

15:34.270 --> 15:36.726
isn't used to win by speed.

15:36.750 --> 15:39.356
Your swordplay is similar to the Downpour Swordplay

15:39.380 --> 15:40.566
of the Liu family.

15:40.590 --> 15:42.826
It seems that the point is the sword.

15:42.850 --> 15:44.436
But in fact, the power comes from the legs.

15:44.460 --> 15:47.166
From the legs to the waist, then to the hands, then to the sword.

15:47.190 --> 15:48.236
So to use this Downpour Swordplay,

15:48.260 --> 15:50.266
the point is to protect the lower body.

15:50.290 --> 15:52.806
But when you use it, you move a lot

15:52.830 --> 15:53.816
and completely ignore the defence...

15:53.840 --> 15:55.690
Forget it...

15:56.870 --> 15:59.636
No one has seen through it, while you pointed it out.

15:59.660 --> 16:00.446
Well...

16:00.470 --> 16:03.140
You just kept talking without fighting anyone.

16:03.670 --> 16:04.686
Jin! Jin!

16:04.710 --> 16:05.926
It's not that I don't wanna help you.

16:05.950 --> 16:06.510
I just thought...

16:06.510 --> 16:08.680
I didn't expect you to be really capable like that.

16:09.150 --> 16:10.276
Miss Shu.

16:10.300 --> 16:10.806
By the way,

16:10.830 --> 16:12.166
the swordplay you use

16:12.190 --> 16:13.606
seems so tricky,

16:13.630 --> 16:15.336
but indeed it's all about defence, not attack.

16:15.360 --> 16:17.296
When the enemy's defence is broken,

16:17.320 --> 16:18.626
you'll give them a fatal blow.

16:18.650 --> 16:22.596
It reminds me of Nandu Shu family's Altair Swordplay.

16:22.620 --> 16:23.066
Yes.

16:23.090 --> 16:24.556
Are you dumb?

16:24.580 --> 16:26.250
Isn't her surname Shu?

16:26.380 --> 16:27.830
Just a coincidence.

16:28.470 --> 16:29.756
I guess so.

16:29.780 --> 16:32.386
I heard that there's no inheritor

16:32.410 --> 16:33.910
of the Shu family's swordplay now.

16:34.070 --> 16:36.800
But your moving technique is also amazing.

16:38.240 --> 16:40.390
I think I've seen it somewhere before.

16:40.960 --> 16:45.490
It seems to be the lost technique of the Golden Wing Secret Agent in the previous dynasty.

16:46.750 --> 16:48.760
Right, here you are.

16:48.830 --> 16:50.280
Mr. Su,

16:50.380 --> 16:52.070
when will the caravan depart?

16:54.350 --> 16:56.430
Miss Shu, Jin,

16:56.710 --> 16:58.916
we really hit it off, and it's a pleasure chatting with you.

16:58.940 --> 17:00.866
When we arrive in Nandu, let me treat you

17:00.890 --> 17:02.156
to something interesting.

17:02.180 --> 17:04.086
Nice...

17:04.110 --> 17:06.586
I've been there several times, but I've never done much sightseeing yet.

17:06.610 --> 17:08.060
Good idea.

17:08.390 --> 17:09.876
Then that's a deal.

17:09.900 --> 17:11.350
-Okay. -Okay.

17:17.170 --> 17:18.859
Hurry up!

17:19.719 --> 17:22.130
[Nice Weather]

17:19.820 --> 17:20.540
This way! Here!

17:20.560 --> 17:22.010
Lend me a hand!

17:24.489 --> 17:25.939
Chief Zhang,

17:26.130 --> 17:29.710
how can you apologize to your master?

17:30.530 --> 17:32.806
Master, I underestimated him.

17:32.830 --> 17:35.460
I didn't expect him to be surrounded by top martial arts masters.

17:38.380 --> 17:40.036
The tea house just sent it to us.

17:40.060 --> 17:42.120
They said the tea leaves were picked this morning.

17:42.300 --> 17:43.960
I guess you'll like it.

17:45.190 --> 17:47.090
How many of our men died?

17:47.570 --> 17:49.150
S-Seventeen.

17:50.080 --> 17:50.936
Bury them well.

17:50.960 --> 17:52.156
Yes, Master.

17:52.180 --> 17:53.016
Master,

17:53.040 --> 17:54.426
please give me one more chance

17:54.450 --> 17:55.566
to make up for my mistake.

17:55.590 --> 17:56.806
If I fail,

17:56.830 --> 17:58.590
I'll kill myself for it.

17:58.870 --> 18:00.320
Zhang Kui,

18:01.590 --> 18:03.440
this is the last time.

18:16.110 --> 18:17.560
He's dead.

18:17.830 --> 18:19.280
We've verified it.

18:19.370 --> 18:20.900
It's true.

18:27.860 --> 18:29.356
-Mr. Qian. -Mr.Qian.

18:29.380 --> 18:30.646
Where is our lady?

18:30.670 --> 18:32.230
In the backyard study.

18:47.070 --> 18:48.520
My lady.

18:54.710 --> 18:57.210
[Su Huairou from the Su Family in Nandu]

18:58.070 --> 18:59.770
You've brought back the raw silk, huh?

19:00.060 --> 19:01.156
Yes, we've brought it all back

19:01.180 --> 19:03.590
and stored it in the Yufeng Warehouse.

19:04.240 --> 19:05.690
Thank you for your hard work.

19:05.850 --> 19:07.300
My lady,

19:07.510 --> 19:09.670
why didn't you wait for me

19:09.820 --> 19:11.596
to come back and handle this tiring work?

19:11.620 --> 19:13.606
If I didn't calculate it myself today,

19:13.630 --> 19:15.900
I wouldn't know how hard your work is.

19:19.640 --> 19:21.090
My lady,

19:21.590 --> 19:24.706
you've been so engaged in the affairs of the Chamber of Commerce.

19:24.730 --> 19:26.486
So please don't waste your time

19:26.510 --> 19:28.400
on the chores of our mansion.

19:29.550 --> 19:32.300
Where's Mingyu? Why hasn't he come back?

19:32.570 --> 19:35.540
[Liansheng House]

19:36.260 --> 19:42.970
[Liansheng House]

19:39.090 --> 19:40.640
Liansheng House?

19:40.690 --> 19:42.140
So magnificent.

19:42.730 --> 19:44.936
Mr. Su, so the first stop on your return

19:44.960 --> 19:46.450
is a gambling house.

19:46.730 --> 19:49.120
Mr. Su, you have such a wide range of hobbies.

19:50.300 --> 19:51.940
Why are you still following us?

19:52.240 --> 19:53.460
Stop arguing. It's a waste of time.

19:53.480 --> 19:54.886
Let's go...

19:54.910 --> 19:56.360
Go...

19:56.940 --> 19:58.390
Let's go inside to take a look.

20:09.010 --> 20:09.886
Mr. Su,

20:09.910 --> 20:11.516
there are so few people here.

20:11.540 --> 20:13.580
Why don't you find a more bustling place to have fun?

20:13.790 --> 20:14.686
Please forgive me, Jin.

20:14.710 --> 20:15.526
To be honest with you,

20:15.550 --> 20:17.030
this Liansheng House is gonna be auctioned tomorrow.

20:17.030 --> 20:18.960
I'm just in a hurry to meet a friend of mine.

20:21.820 --> 20:23.450
Gambling is the same wherever you are.

20:44.490 --> 20:46.430
[Ke Menglan from the Liansheng House]

20:44.790 --> 20:46.206
Guys,

20:46.230 --> 20:47.840
place and finalize your bets.

20:48.720 --> 20:49.966
All in.

20:49.990 --> 20:51.286
Mr. Qi, are you skipping this round?

20:51.310 --> 20:54.146
The Liansheng House will be auctioned tomorrow.

20:54.170 --> 20:56.266
You'd better think carefully.

20:56.290 --> 20:58.260
Mr. Qi, as I told you,

20:59.370 --> 21:02.340
eleven on the left, and eleven on the right.

21:02.510 --> 21:03.706
It's a draw.

21:03.730 --> 21:04.746
The banker takes all.

21:04.770 --> 21:06.076
-I lost again... -I lost again.

21:06.100 --> 21:07.916
You still have a few hours to think about it.

21:07.940 --> 21:09.976
If nothing was gonna change in the Liansheng House,

21:10.000 --> 21:11.836
I wouldn't have persuaded you to follow me.

21:11.860 --> 21:14.516
But the Tangs' Gambling House has already said,

21:14.540 --> 21:17.110
if you're auctioned off to the Tang family,

21:17.150 --> 21:17.950
then...

21:17.950 --> 21:19.690
I want your seat.

21:20.190 --> 21:21.640
Are you kidding me?

21:23.370 --> 21:25.210
It's you, Mr. Su.

21:33.110 --> 21:34.046
Sit down please,

21:34.070 --> 21:34.756
Mr. Su.

21:34.780 --> 21:36.230
Jin.

21:36.890 --> 21:37.766
Here you are.

21:37.790 --> 21:38.926
Okay.

21:38.950 --> 21:41.430
This girl looks so beautiful.

21:43.620 --> 21:44.996
I haven't gambled for days.

21:45.020 --> 21:46.580
I quite miss it.

21:46.850 --> 21:48.086
Menglan,

21:48.110 --> 21:49.466
Jin is my friend.

21:49.490 --> 21:50.486
Please go easy on him.

21:50.510 --> 21:51.366
Nonsense!

21:51.390 --> 21:52.496
When did I ever lose?

21:52.520 --> 21:54.086
Girl, don't listen to him!

21:54.110 --> 21:57.390
Just show me what you've got.

22:15.910 --> 22:17.720
Do you know this Liansheng House

22:17.900 --> 22:19.750
used to be Godfather's property?

22:28.390 --> 22:28.910
Come on...

22:28.910 --> 22:29.846
Place the bet here.

22:29.870 --> 22:30.806
Where to place the bet?

22:30.830 --> 22:32.620
I choose this!

22:36.910 --> 22:38.656
It's rare to have a place to relax.

22:38.680 --> 22:41.410
Why do you have so much on your mind?

22:43.040 --> 22:44.490
I'm wondering

22:44.660 --> 22:46.276
why Su Mingyu

22:46.300 --> 22:47.800
happened to bring us here.

22:48.870 --> 22:50.320
Don't bother thinking about it.

22:55.430 --> 22:56.940
A day without her

22:57.790 --> 22:59.440
can make him miss her like crazy.

23:01.250 --> 23:03.836
The story between a young master of a noble family and a female croupier in a gambling house.

23:03.860 --> 23:05.306
Sounds great in a novel,

23:05.330 --> 23:07.570
but it's hard in real life.

23:15.000 --> 23:16.646
Godfather owned businesses

23:16.670 --> 23:18.096
all over Nandu in his prime.

23:18.120 --> 23:19.570
It was so glorious.

23:19.720 --> 23:21.226
But once he lost power,

23:21.250 --> 23:23.880
the merchants in Nandu were like wolves devouring a tiger.

23:24.060 --> 23:26.136
Soon, this Liansheng House became the only one left.

23:26.160 --> 23:27.800
Even this will also disappear, I'm afraid.

23:34.780 --> 23:36.500
Not necessarily.

23:36.550 --> 23:38.006
What does saving Liansheng House have to do

23:38.030 --> 23:39.940
with your revenge?

23:40.140 --> 23:42.440
What exactly is the purpose of your trip this time?

23:50.110 --> 23:51.560
Miss Shu,

23:52.390 --> 23:55.036
can you first tell me

23:55.060 --> 23:57.306
who is qualified to learn the moving technique

23:57.330 --> 23:59.600
of the Golden Wing Secret Agent in the previous dynasty?

23:59.890 --> 24:02.456
As far as I know, this technique can only be learned...

24:02.480 --> 24:05.210
Yes, only in the Lingyuan Sect.

24:08.070 --> 24:10.150
You admit that you're a Lingyuan rebel?

24:11.750 --> 24:14.216
Three years ago, I once travelled to Ganzhou

24:14.240 --> 24:16.600
and saved a dying Lingyuan Sect member.

24:17.950 --> 24:20.690
The secret skills of the Lingyuan Sect are never passed on to outsiders.

24:20.990 --> 24:24.966
He probably tried to lure me to join the Lingyuan Sect.

24:24.990 --> 24:26.476
Did you

24:26.500 --> 24:27.950
learn their martial arts

24:27.970 --> 24:29.526
and then find a chance to run away?

24:29.550 --> 24:31.000
Exactly.

24:35.250 --> 24:36.700
Wait.

24:37.140 --> 24:40.310
Haven't you been determined to take revenge on Qi Tianfeng?

24:40.640 --> 24:42.806
Why didn't you join them

24:42.830 --> 24:44.166
after you learned the skills of the Lingyuan Sect?

24:44.190 --> 24:47.030
Your Yuntai Sect has a feud with the Lingyuan Sect.

24:47.080 --> 24:48.276
If I joined the Lingyuan Sect,

24:48.300 --> 24:50.520
how could I face Godfather again?

24:55.470 --> 24:57.050
Flawless.

25:00.150 --> 25:02.526
The imperial court also sees the Yuntai Sect as a big threat,

25:02.550 --> 25:05.446
while you didn't hide your identity at all.

25:05.470 --> 25:07.356
It makes me sort of suspicious.

25:07.380 --> 25:08.426
What?

25:08.450 --> 25:10.790
If you wanted to turn me in, you wouldn't have waited until today.

25:11.090 --> 25:13.180
Why do you think I have mercy on you?

25:15.450 --> 25:17.510
You have both eyes for me.

25:20.150 --> 25:23.580
See more carefully now.

25:36.310 --> 25:39.070
The figure is slightly distorted,

25:39.470 --> 25:41.520
but the face is still outstanding.

25:42.270 --> 25:43.726
Don't flatter yourself.

25:43.750 --> 25:46.180
No girls will like your words.

25:48.190 --> 25:50.310
Are you playing tricks with me?

25:53.310 --> 25:54.206
Jin,

25:54.230 --> 25:56.160
take a rest if you have bad luck for now.

25:59.210 --> 26:00.660
Wait.

26:01.150 --> 26:02.906
Why didn't you place any bets

26:02.930 --> 26:04.870
after I got to the table?

26:05.560 --> 26:08.406
We wanna tell the trend through you, of course.

26:08.430 --> 26:10.836
Bro, although you look kind of silly,

26:10.860 --> 26:12.730
you're so strong.

26:14.310 --> 26:15.726
Girl,

26:15.750 --> 26:17.200
can I pay on credit?

26:18.140 --> 26:21.390
We usually don't allow that.

26:21.720 --> 26:24.306
But since you're Mr. Su's friend...

26:24.330 --> 26:25.106
No, Menglan.

26:25.130 --> 26:26.580
Stay out of this.

26:27.690 --> 26:29.446
Jin, you lost 30 taels.

26:29.470 --> 26:31.626
Then I can give you 30 taels on credit,

26:31.650 --> 26:33.720
until you win them back. How about that?

26:34.340 --> 26:35.790
Wonderful!

26:37.990 --> 26:39.836
He's fond of gambling but not good at it.

26:39.860 --> 26:41.206
That's really a vice.

26:41.230 --> 26:43.596
I was just thinking about how to keep him by my side.

26:43.620 --> 26:45.070
This is a good chance.

26:46.040 --> 26:49.090
You wanna take advantage of his weakness, yet you sound so proud.

26:49.500 --> 26:50.736
Are all the Yuntai members

26:50.760 --> 26:52.226
so shameless?

26:52.250 --> 26:54.286
Use some shameless tricks

26:54.310 --> 26:56.390
to achieve something great and honorable.

26:56.750 --> 26:59.176
This is similar to how you learned

26:59.200 --> 27:00.720
the martial arts of the Lingyuan Sect.

27:01.510 --> 27:04.980
You've come for more than revenge, right?

27:06.440 --> 27:07.890
Yes,

27:09.030 --> 27:10.480
or not.

27:11.430 --> 27:12.886
You're full of lies.

27:12.910 --> 27:14.116
You want me to team up with you?

27:14.140 --> 27:15.590
Just forget about that.

27:20.850 --> 27:22.890
Sir and Madam, please have some tea first.

27:23.570 --> 27:25.150
Just leave this to me.

27:27.590 --> 27:28.876
Don't come unless I ask you to.

27:28.900 --> 27:30.350
Thank you, sir.

27:36.910 --> 27:37.736
Miss,

27:37.760 --> 27:39.686
you're really smart.

27:39.710 --> 27:40.796
You're right.

27:40.820 --> 27:42.730
I do have other plans.

27:43.220 --> 27:45.350
But I wasn't lying when I proposed

27:46.030 --> 27:47.480
to deal with Qi Tianfeng.

27:48.070 --> 27:49.600
How can I trust you?

27:52.590 --> 27:54.040
Within this month,

27:54.430 --> 27:55.936
I'll destroy Qi Tianfeng

27:55.960 --> 27:58.770
and his Cao Sect.

27:59.560 --> 28:01.010
Your departure or stay is up to you.

28:01.170 --> 28:03.236
But if you decide to join hands with me,

28:03.260 --> 28:05.260
I need you to promise me one thing.

28:05.510 --> 28:06.466
Go ahead.

28:06.490 --> 28:09.116
You and I do our part and complement each other.

28:09.140 --> 28:10.736
But please don't ask the reason

28:10.760 --> 28:12.006
for my commission.

28:12.030 --> 28:13.136
When it's done,

28:13.160 --> 28:14.606
if you still don't understand,

28:14.630 --> 28:16.430
I'll explain it to you.

28:19.570 --> 28:21.020
Deal.

28:21.060 --> 28:23.236
But I have a blood feud.

28:23.260 --> 28:24.776
If you change your mind halfway,

28:24.800 --> 28:26.136
your Run for Ten Breaths,

28:26.160 --> 28:27.166
or even Run for A Hundred Breaths...

28:27.190 --> 28:28.376
I know.

28:28.400 --> 28:30.440
You'll show me no mercy.

28:31.580 --> 28:33.270
When did you ever show mercy?

28:33.580 --> 28:36.150
You deserve it for talking nonsense.

28:36.820 --> 28:38.810
No more jokes. Let's get down to business.

28:39.010 --> 28:40.770
Now, the merchants in Nandu

28:40.980 --> 28:42.970
are ready to divide up Mr. Wen's business.

28:43.400 --> 28:44.746
But you should know that

28:44.770 --> 28:47.260
it's usually about a series of debts in business.

28:47.500 --> 28:48.956
There were some debts Mr. Wen owed them,

28:48.980 --> 28:50.960
and some they owed Mr. Wen, of course.

28:51.580 --> 28:54.196
Are you gonna collect all the debts?

28:54.220 --> 28:56.460
Exactly. Thank you, Miss.

28:59.310 --> 29:00.606
But Mr. Wen has passed away.

29:00.630 --> 29:02.126
Who would admit their debts?

29:02.150 --> 29:03.990
That depends on your tactics.

29:04.660 --> 29:06.086
This thing matters a lot.

29:06.110 --> 29:06.896
There's no time to waste.

29:06.920 --> 29:08.570
You'd better set off right away.

29:26.050 --> 29:28.276
You may soon run into lots of hard nuts to crack.

29:28.300 --> 29:30.190
Be careful.

29:30.680 --> 29:31.966
What's the use of just talking?

29:31.990 --> 29:33.440
How about we go together?

29:53.110 --> 29:54.246
Jin,

29:54.270 --> 29:55.720
black or red?

29:56.300 --> 29:57.696
Black or red?

29:57.720 --> 29:59.170
You tell me!

30:00.150 --> 30:01.386
How would I know?

30:01.410 --> 30:02.860
So useless!

30:06.350 --> 30:07.800
Still red!

30:09.620 --> 30:11.070
Okay.

30:11.430 --> 30:12.556
Hold on!

30:12.580 --> 30:14.030
Let me take a closer look.

30:18.270 --> 30:19.766
Black, 14.

30:19.790 --> 30:22.096
18, 18, 18...

30:22.120 --> 30:24.370
18, 18, 18!

30:25.990 --> 30:28.350
Red, 12.

30:28.980 --> 30:30.430
Black wins.

30:32.710 --> 30:34.026
Sir,

30:34.050 --> 30:36.266
you lost and borrowed 60 taels in total.

30:36.290 --> 30:40.090
If you lose all the money, do you need our help?

30:40.630 --> 30:42.310
I'm gonna kill you, you know?

30:42.630 --> 30:43.796
Don't worry, Jin.

30:43.820 --> 30:45.366
You still have me to cover

30:45.390 --> 30:46.556
your daily expenses these days.

30:46.580 --> 30:48.726
You lost and borrowed 60 taels of gold in total, huh?

30:48.750 --> 30:50.050
How long do you have to stay in the Sus' mansion

30:50.070 --> 30:51.520
to make up for this money?

30:52.090 --> 30:54.210
Why are you so sarcastic again?

30:56.190 --> 30:57.196
Mr. Su,

30:57.220 --> 30:58.226
you brought Jin to the gambling house

30:58.250 --> 31:00.350
on the first stop in Nandu, huh?

31:08.110 --> 31:10.286
You two set me up!

31:10.310 --> 31:11.830
Jin, I didn't.

31:15.490 --> 31:17.270
Jin, you must be joking.

31:17.390 --> 31:19.006
In front of everyone,

31:19.030 --> 31:19.946
I

31:19.970 --> 31:23.020
dare not gamble with the reputation of the Liansheng House.

31:27.090 --> 31:28.236
Yeah.

31:28.260 --> 31:31.326
You don't need to play any tricks against him.

31:31.350 --> 31:33.780
I'm gonna kill you if you insult me again,

31:33.840 --> 31:35.290
for free.

31:35.630 --> 31:37.150
It's 60 taels of gold,

31:37.420 --> 31:38.960
the money for killing 6 people.

31:39.780 --> 31:42.250
Are you willing to donate it to the gambling house for nothing?

31:43.150 --> 31:45.640
Who on earth are you siding with?

31:46.590 --> 31:48.036
Miss,

31:48.060 --> 31:50.266
I still have 60 taels left.

31:50.290 --> 31:51.836
Can I play a game with you?

31:51.860 --> 31:53.046
Just one round to decide the winner.

31:53.070 --> 31:55.810
Let's bet on the 60 taels of gold he just lost.

31:56.280 --> 31:58.240
How do you want to play it?

31:58.320 --> 31:59.596
You and I each hold a cup.

31:59.620 --> 32:02.740
If we get the same number after the opening, I win.

32:02.850 --> 32:05.076
If not, you win.

32:05.100 --> 32:06.550
How about that?

32:10.800 --> 32:12.426
Menglan, don't play it with him.

32:12.450 --> 32:14.010
This man's so cunning.

32:16.490 --> 32:19.310
Okay, let's play as you say.

32:24.870 --> 32:26.086
Guys,

32:26.110 --> 32:27.620
please keep quiet.

32:28.260 --> 32:29.820
This gambling game

32:29.880 --> 32:31.630
all depends on listening.

32:32.200 --> 32:33.650
Thank you.

32:48.540 --> 32:49.990
After you, Miss.

33:34.970 --> 33:36.420
It's your turn, sir.

34:03.300 --> 34:04.750
I'm done.

34:06.110 --> 34:06.946
Can that work?

34:06.970 --> 34:09.380
-He didn't shake it! -He didn't
even shake it!

34:16.819 --> 34:18.396
Red, 10

34:18.420 --> 34:19.930
It's 10.

34:21.420 --> 34:22.870
Black...

34:44.020 --> 34:45.749
You are so lucky, sir.

34:45.799 --> 34:47.790
I lost.

34:52.129 --> 34:53.579
Jin.

35:09.150 --> 35:11.390
How many more unique skills do you have?

35:18.210 --> 35:20.010
Yun Xiang! Yun Xiang!

35:20.890 --> 35:22.340
Yun Xiang!

35:24.190 --> 35:27.590
Fragrant bags, sachets, and pendants.

35:32.640 --> 35:34.016
Give that to me. You've kept it for a long time.

35:34.040 --> 35:34.826
What?

35:34.850 --> 35:36.366
My 30 taels of gold!

35:36.390 --> 35:38.046
Are you kidding me?

35:38.070 --> 35:39.926
I won that money with my skill.

35:39.950 --> 35:41.270
Besides, I even removed your debt

35:41.270 --> 35:42.236
of 30 taels of gold.

35:42.260 --> 35:43.106
You...

35:43.130 --> 35:44.036
Jin,

35:44.060 --> 35:45.536
as a great warrior,

35:45.560 --> 35:47.150
you won't play dumb with me, will you?

35:49.590 --> 35:50.566
Do you have any enemies?

35:50.590 --> 35:52.860
I'll kill a few for you, at half price.

35:53.750 --> 35:54.886
Then how about this?

35:54.910 --> 35:56.856
You condescend to follow me for some days,

35:56.880 --> 35:59.530
and I pay you 1 tael of gold every day, huh?

36:00.880 --> 36:03.620
You tricked me.

36:04.510 --> 36:05.670
I know you've worked so hard

36:05.690 --> 36:07.140
in the past few days.

36:09.230 --> 36:10.546
Take this money,

36:10.570 --> 36:13.100
and find an inn to have a good rest.

36:13.450 --> 36:14.766
What do you mean?

36:14.790 --> 36:16.290
You don't need me now?

36:19.220 --> 36:21.590
I hope you get killed by the Cao Sect!

36:46.390 --> 36:48.770
[Servant Girl, Tianhu]

36:56.010 --> 36:59.030
Are you worried about the auction?

37:02.790 --> 37:04.690
We'll know the result tomorrow.

37:05.150 --> 37:06.910
Now, the only person we can rely on

37:07.690 --> 37:09.650
is Mr. Su.

37:17.900 --> 37:19.350
Menglan.

37:27.870 --> 37:29.046
Don't be sad.

37:29.070 --> 37:30.126
The auction is tomorrow.

37:30.150 --> 37:32.370
No matter how much you win today, it's hard to change the situation.

37:34.910 --> 37:36.470
I know, of course.

37:36.850 --> 37:39.496
I just want Tianhu and the others

37:39.520 --> 37:40.990
to lead a better life.

37:42.150 --> 37:44.166
Tang Xiao can't take Liansheng House away

37:44.190 --> 37:46.326
Look, I've saved 3,000 taels of silver.

37:46.350 --> 37:48.700
I'm sure I can win it at tomorrow's auction.

37:51.060 --> 37:53.640
Thank you for your kindness, Mr. Su.

37:54.150 --> 37:57.950
But could you please be more prudent when you say anything in the future?

37:59.510 --> 38:03.070
You once promised you'd ask Chairman Su

38:03.190 --> 38:05.296
to stop Tang Xiao from bidding.

38:05.320 --> 38:06.770
Did you do it?

38:09.160 --> 38:11.190
-Menglan... -I guess you tried,

38:11.270 --> 38:13.700
but Chairman Su refused.

38:18.170 --> 38:22.540
I know you don't mind my menial background.

38:24.520 --> 38:27.480
But how can the Su family accept it?

38:28.280 --> 38:30.030
So please

38:30.180 --> 38:31.750
don't waste your time, sir.

38:31.870 --> 38:34.180
Menglan. Menglan!

38:34.750 --> 38:36.516
Time will prove my sincerity.

38:36.540 --> 38:37.526
Tomorrow...

38:37.550 --> 38:39.570
I'll protect Liansheng House tomorrow.

38:56.690 --> 38:59.400
[Guanghui Bank]

39:12.810 --> 39:14.260
Please keep it well.

39:17.870 --> 39:19.320
I wanna deposit this.

39:25.230 --> 39:26.016
Liu,

39:26.040 --> 39:27.236
are you here to deposit money again?

39:27.260 --> 39:28.366
This way, please.

39:28.390 --> 39:29.840
Please.

39:31.250 --> 39:33.210
Mr. Wang, this way, please.

39:33.270 --> 39:34.750
This way, please.

39:44.130 --> 39:46.156
Sir, we only do business with regular customers on the list.

39:46.180 --> 39:47.800
No deposit or withdrawal for other customers.

39:48.130 --> 39:49.456
I do have an account here.

39:49.480 --> 39:52.366
Our Guanghui Bank deposits money for many major merchants in Nandu.

39:52.390 --> 39:53.726
There's a large number of them,

39:53.020 --> 39:55.360
[Kang Qiao from the Yuntai Sect]

39:53.750 --> 39:55.330
but I've never seen you before, sir.

39:55.390 --> 39:57.800
May I have your account name?

40:01.010 --> 40:03.550
No.1 of Qian.
